### 관리자: 일일 정산 수동 실행 (재실행 안전)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/settlements/daily/run?date=2026-11-15
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 창작자: 내 정산 잔액
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/creator/settlements/balance
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 창작자: 일별 정산 내역
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/creator/settlements/daily
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 창작자: 판매·환불 내역
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/creator/settlements/sales
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 관리자: 창작자 계약 수수료 설정 (creatorId 빼면 기본 요율 변경)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/fee-policies
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "creatorId": 1,
  "revenueType": "CONTENT",
  "feeRate": "0.1000",
  "reason": "우수 창작자 계약"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("feePolicyId", response.body.id);
%}

### 관리자: 수수료 이력 (creatorId 없으면 기본 요율)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/fee-policies?creatorId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 관리자: 창작자에게 지금 적용되는 요율
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/fee-policies/applied?creatorId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 관리자: 계약 종료 (endAt 빼면 지금)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/fee-policies/{{feePolicyId}}/end
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "계약 만료"
}

### 창작자: 내 수수료율
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/creator/settlements/fee-rates
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
